# vehje-typecheck. Core check pass

The framework's Core-level check pass (the `vehje-check` role; the crate
dir keeps the `vehje-typecheck` name until a later cosmetic rename). Checks
the resolved Core IR, generic over the family set, with family-extension
hooks for family-specific checks (a consumer's coherence, routing, or
fragment rules). A framework-owned Core pass, not a consumer pass.
`#![no_std]`, no alloc.
